  data:
    partName: Right Tibia (Shin Bone)
    scientificName: Tibia Dextra
    systemType: 1
    keyFunction: Major weight-bearing long bone of lower leg; transmits all body mass down from knee to ankle.
    description: Features broad tibial plateau, anterior tibial crest, and prominent medial malleolus (inner ankle).
    clinicalFacts:
    - Supports ~85% of lower leg mechanical body load.
    - Subcutaneous anterior border is palpable along entirety of shin.
