    scientificName: Vertebrae Lumbales
    systemType: 1
    keyFunction: Heaviest 5 vertebrae supporting upper body weight and trunk flexibility.
    description: Characterized by massive kidney-shaped vertebral bodies and sturdy quadrangular spinous processes.
