    systemType: 7
    keyFunction: Paired vertical muscle strap separated by linea alba and partitioned by tendinous intersections (the 'six-pack').
    description: "Originates from pubic crest and pubic symphysis; inserts into 5th\u20137th costal cartilages and xiphoid process."
    clinicalFacts:
    - 'Primary Action: Flexes thoracic and lumbar vertebral column; raises intra-abdominal pressure during forced expiration.'
    - "Innervation: Lower thoracic intercostal and subcostal nerves (T7\u2013T12)."
    - Enclosed inside aponeurotic rectus sheath.
  baseColor: {r: 0.9, g: 0.19999996, b: 0.29999998, a: 1}
  hoverColor: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
