  data:
    partName: Temporal Lobes (Left & Right)
    scientificName: Lobi Temporales
    systemType: 5
    keyFunction: Lateral cerebral lobes managing auditory processing, language comprehension (Wernicke's area), and memory encoding.
    description: Houses the hippocampus, amygdala, and primary auditory cortex (transverse temporal gyri of Heschl).
    clinicalFacts:
    - Hippocampal formations inside medial temporal lobes consolidate short-term to long-term memory.
    - "Temporal lobe epilepsy can trigger d\xE9j\xE0 vu and auditory auras."
