    partName: Sternum (Breastbone)
    scientificName: Sternum
    systemType: 1
    keyFunction: Flat elongated bone situated anteriorly along thoracic midline, anchoring anterior rib cage.
    description: 'Composed of 3 segments: manubrium, body (gladiolus), and xiphoid process.'
    clinicalFacts:
    - Sternal angle (Angle of Louis) marks level of second costal cartilage.
    - Clinically accessible site for red bone marrow aspiration.
